{number: 25}
{title: Angels, From the Realms of Glory}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] Angels from the [F] realms of [C] glory,
[F] Wing your [C] flight o'er [G] all the [C] earth;
[C] Ye who sang cre-[F] ation's [C] story
[F] Now pro-[C] claim Mes-[G] siah's [C] birth:
[G] Come and worship, [C] come and worship,
[F] Worship [C] Christ, the [G7] newborn [C] King!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C] Shepherds in the [F] field a-[C] biding,
[F] Watching [C] o'er your [G] flocks by [C] night;
[C] God with man is [F] now re-[C] siding,
[F] Yonder [C] shines the [G] infant-[C] light:
[G] Come and worship, [C] come and worship,
[F] Worship [C] Christ, the [G7] newborn [C] King!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C] Sages, leave your [F] contem-[C] plations;
[F] Brighter [C] visions [G] beam a-[C] far:
[C] Seek the great De-[F] sire of [C] nations,
[F] Ye have [C] seen His [G] natal [C] star:
[G] Come and worship, [C] come and worship,
[F] Worship [C] Christ, the [G7] newborn [C] King!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C] Saints before the [F] altar [C] bending,
[F] Watching [C] long in [G] hope and [C] fear,
[C] Suddenly the [F] Lord, de-[C] scending,
[F] In His [C] temple [G] shall ap-[C] pear:
[G] Come and worship, [C] come and worship,
[F] Worship [C] Christ, the [G7] newborn [C] King!
{end_of_verse}
